[{"client_msg_id":"8ae072d7-976f-4e9a-af43-43f79f284aa0","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"おぉー。重大ミッションだ。","ts":"1622106871.050500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bg0w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A5D3DF06-E2A3-4346-BF1A-6ECD43837F54","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"明日、上の子3才の初めての遠足なので、お弁当を作るという重大なミッションがあります。","ts":"1622097617.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"37LeA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cf739f3-b629-493d-84c2-52f2e2c07e81","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕も「はらぺこあおむし」は絵本みなくてもお話できます。","ts":"1622085605.048900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bLs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48A3E196-9AFA-4DE3-B002-DF0FACD1110B","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"食いつきすごいですよね。\nうちの子も「あおむし！あおむし！」ってよく言ってました。（最近は読んでってあまり言われないけど）","ts":"1622084151.048700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MU2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e548d0a-4c20-4cce-9fa3-9d78da2b1338","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"大人が見ても良い絵本だなと思いますが、それ以上に子供のあの食い付きはなんなんでしょうね。不思議\nうちの子まだ10ヶ月なので絶対内容理解できてないはずなんですが","ts":"1622083584.047400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=PQR2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4cfb62e-ede2-43ae-83f9-fec9c7d9e3fe","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"はらぺこあおむし、家にはないけど、保育園で全部覚えてきて、色々すごい（人気と子供の記憶力）なって思いました。","ts":"1622083349.045700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MnP9P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C74D8543-10A1-49AA-B78E-164CD7FB5D61","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"はらぺこあおむしは僕もお世話になったので悲しい。","ts":"1622082992.043800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0pC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56fa7a82-796a-4e49-9176-fe801a19358c","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ですです","ts":"1622082623.042500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ehsh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4A8C4FE3-74B4-4753-88F5-A3766A5F4637","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"誰かと思ったら、はらぺこあおむしの人なんですね","ts":"1622081695.042200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gI4w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"585636FF-78DA-4312-87D2-7DFB2101287B","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"エリックカールさん亡くなったそうですね","ts":"1622075640.041400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UcRK"}]}]
